# A door's static ability has the timestamp of the Room it is on (CR 613.7a: "the same timestamp as the object the static
# ability is on"); unlocking a door is no event that gives the permanent a new one (CR 613.7d-k). Bot1's Room enters in
# turn 1 with Dollmaker's Shop unlocked, Opalescence follows in turn 3 and makes it a creature with base power and
# toughness equal to its mana value (layer 7b), and in turn 5 Bot1 unlocks Porcelain Gallery. Both are layer 7b effects
# on the Room: the Gallery's (the Room's timestamp, turn 1) applies first and Opalescence's (turn 3) after it, so the Room
# is 8/8, its mana value with both doors unlocked ({5}{W}{W}{W}, CR 709.5), while Memnite is 2/2 (two creatures). In
# turn 7 Turn to Frog takes the Room's abilities (layer 6): the Gallery's static is gone with them (CR 613.1f, 709.5), so
# Memnite is 1/1 again and the Room a 1/1 Frog.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Dollmaker's Shop // Porcelain Gallery
Memnite
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Opalescence
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Turn to Frog
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

